OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and a
OL,6,Ffew showers may affect southwestern
OL,7,Fcoasts overnight, while most places
OL,8,Fstay dry with variable cloud. Winds
OL,9,Feasing in the south but remaining
OL,10,Fbreezy in the west. Temperatures
OL,11,Fmilder than last night, near average
OL,12,Foverall.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FCloudy across southern areas
OL,15,Fwith sporadic showers, some becoming
OL,16,Fheavy and thundery from late
OL,17,Fafternoon. Elsewhere, most places will
OL,18,Fstay dry with hazy sunshine. Feeling
OL,19,Fincreasingly humid for all.
